  "comment": "Pinned third-party programs that release builds bundle (Phase 7 Stage 1). tools/fetch-binaries.ps1 downloads each url into tools/bin/downloads, checks its sha256 (and fails on a mismatch), and copies the files listed in take into app/src-tauri/resources/<dest>, where the shell looks for <dest>/<dest>.exe (sidecar.rs, tool_from). sha256From says where the pinned hash was checked. licenses: license texts fetched from the upstream tags and pinned by sha256 the same way, copied into <dest>/<as> (Phase 7 Stage 2; ffmpeg's LICENSE and README.txt come from its pinned zip through take). Bumping a version: change version, url, sha256 (and inner/take if the archive's layout changed, and the licenses' tags and hashes), run the script, then the live checks in docs/phases/phase-7-packaging-release.md section 10.",
